<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Bella Vista Dining · Cashier</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/app.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/billing.css"><script src="/assets/js/billing.js?v={{version}}" defer></script><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/brand/bella-vista-mark.svg"></head>
<body><a class="skip-link" href="#cashier">Skip to cashier</a><header class="wrap billing-header"><a class="brand" href="/"><svg class="bella-vista-mark" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="36" height="36" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M9 32V21a15 15 0 0 1 30 0v11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 35h34M11 39c7 5 19 5 26 0M24 31V19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M24 25c-7 0-11-4-11-9 7 0 11 3 11 9Zm0-4c0-7 4-10 10-10 0 6-3 10-10 10Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg><span>Bella Vista Dining</span></a><nav aria-label="Staff workspaces"><a href="/admin">Reservations</a> <a href="/server">Food orders</a></nav><span id="cashier-user"></span></header>
<main class="wrap" id="cashier"><p class="eyebrow">Onsite settlement</p><h1>Cashier.</h1><p>Record cash received or a card payment already completed outside this app. No card details or online charges are processed here.</p><p class="fine-print">Academic preview: use demonstration payments only. Recorded receipts describe staff actions; they do not transfer money.</p><p id="billing-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><form id="billing-filter"><label>Service date · Manila<input name="date" type="date" required disabled></label><button class="button ghost" type="submit">Load reservations</button></form><div class="billing-layout"><section aria-label="Reservations"><h2>Choose a reservation</h2><div id="billing-list"></div></section><section id="billing-detail" aria-label="Bill detail"><p>Select a reservation to review its food, fees and receipts.</p></section></div></main></body></html>
